        <article class="spec-row">
          <div class="spec-kind">
            <span class="spec-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><Glyph name="braces" size={18} /></span>
            <h3>Request and response</h3>
            <p class="label">The precise one</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>
              Choose the method, set headers, send a body with its content type, then assert on
              what comes back. Six body assertions, and JSON paths that understand nesting and
              array indices.
            </p>
            <div class="spec-values">
              <code>GET</code>
              <code>POST</code>
              <code>PUT</code>
              <code>PATCH</code>
              <code>DELETE</code>
              <code>HEAD</code>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-values">
              <code>contains</code>
              <code>does not contain</code>
              <code>exactly equals</code>
              <code>matches regex</code>
              <code>JSON field equals</code>
              <code>JSON field exists</code>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-values">
